									<b>Guild Rules</b><br>
									<br>
As much as I hate dictating how you should play the game, here are a few rules to live by here in Brute Squad. Please try to abide by them as the consequences will range from counseling by me or removal from the guild for those who repeatedly violate them.<br><br>1) Do unto others as you would have them do unto you.  The Golden Rule. If we play nice to all, then hopefully they will return the favor.<br><br>2) No Ninja Looting.  See previous post<br><br>3) No Lone Wolf Looting. Waiting for a MOB to be lootable that some else killed without his/her permission, or at least looking to see if there is someone in the area.<br><br>4) NO Begging from PC&#039;s. This is not only annoying and rude, but we in the guild have an equipment bank that you can use.<br><br>5) NO Getting an item via begging then turning around and selling it in front of the giver&#039;s face.   RUDE, need I say more.<br><br>6) No going AFK without telling your party. This puts their lives on the line trying to save you, when you dont care about them.<br><br>7) No Kill Stealing. We understand the occasional OOPS You were pulling him? But not intentional.<br><br><br>Please try to be nice out there and respect the other players, Most of you already do. This post is for the few that dont. Sorry to be such a hard ***  but this is a game, lets enjoy the HECK out of it, and promote The Brute Squad&#039;s image in the community.<br><br>Thank you,<br>
